  "synopsis": "Cassis is the only daughter of a bakery in the small town of Fran. Her daily routine is to deliver freshly baked bread to the people of the town every morning. One day, a blonde young man named Arles comes to Cassis's shop. She is gradually drawn to him for his refreshing and gentle gaze. However, there is a reason why the young man has come to this town.\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)",
